WEBVTT

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:16.140
Meklord Emperor Granel 
gains attack points equal

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:19.970
to the absorbed Synchro Monster's 
original attack points!

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:24.360
So this is Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.050
Jack, hang in there!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:30.890
Jack!

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:37.070
Director Yeager, they take real 
damage on Team New World's field.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.800
It's too dangerous to continue!

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.780
Can't we stop the finals?

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:45.920
As the tournament's administrator, 
I thought about doing that.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:51.960
But I know they'll win and save the world.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.700
That's what I believe!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.350
Don't go, Crow!

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:01.660
If you face that monster, you'll die!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:03.840
That's right, Crow!  Don't go!

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.090
What are you talking about?  Let go!

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:06.780
No!

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:07.760
Crow, please!

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:12.370
No!  Even after losing consciousness, 
Jack still passed the baton to me!

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.650
I can't quit!

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:24.300
We have to do whatever it takes to stop that!

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:28.130
Don't worry!

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:31.600
There's no way Crow is gonna die!

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:38.750
Team New World's Jose and Meklord Emperor 
Granel return to the home stretch!

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:40.300
Here I go!

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.910
Team 5D's passed the baton 
to Crow, the second Wheeler!

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:51.420
We're worried about the status of the first 
Wheeler Jack Atlas, but the race continues!

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.560
Crow, don't die.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.270
Riding Duels.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.350
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:07.290
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:14.910
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:19.280
Is a new legendary duel

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:36.400
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:42.040
Set free your infinite potential

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:47.450
Every beginning is up to you

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:53.950
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.320
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:05.160
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:12.970
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:18.340
Even if you can't see your destination

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:23.850
Run on your feet without fear

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:29.390
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:36.430
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:56.680
Giant Emperor Obstructs!Meklord 
Emperor Granel

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.950
Wait, you freak!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.460
I'm your next opponent!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:12.430
I applaud you for still showing up after 
witnessing Meklord Emperor Granel's power.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.930
Oh wow!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:18.780
I thought he would be too 
scared to show up, but he did.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:26.600
The more energy they use during the duel, 
the quicker the Circuit will be completed.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:32.070
Face my Granel with all your power!

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:35.070
Show me what a human can do!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.420
All my power...

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.960
I don't have a special card 
like Shooting Star Dragon

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.330
or Red Nova Dragon that can 
take on Synchro killers.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.530
Furthermore, he has over 15000 attack points.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:48.680
I might really die.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.780
But I have ways to fight back.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:58.260
I won't fight recklessly.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:04:59.910
Here I go!

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:00.680
Duel!

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:06.360
My turn!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:13.260
I can't let my guard down against 
a monster with 15500 attack points.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:16.210
Sorry Yusei, but I'm going to use this!

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.200
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:24.150
By removing 10 Speed Counters, 
I destroy one card on the field!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.310
Crow already used 10 Speed Counters!

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.220
It's fine.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.650
You can't play around with 
an opponent like him.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:34.240
I destroy Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:38.550
I activate the trap Infinity Wall!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.510
What?  A trap specifically 
for Meklord Emperors?

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:45.000
Destruction from a card 
effect is negated this turn!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.160
Did you really think I wouldn't have 
countermeasures against Speed World 2?

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.900
So this level of strategy 
doesn't work against you.

00:05:56.140 --> 00:06:01.430
In that case, I summon the Tuner 
Monster Blackwing - Steam the Cloaked!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:11.480
When a Blackwing is on my field, I can 
Special Summon this card from my hand!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.420
I Special Summon Blackwing - Bora the Spear!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:21.350
He has a Tuner and another monster!

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.060
He can now Synchro Summon, but...

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.540
It's pointless to Synchro Summon when 
you're facing a Meklord Emperor.

00:06:30.380 --> 00:06:34.910
Do you seriously think that Crow the 
trickster would use such a simple strategy?

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:38.740
I remove Steam the Cloaked 
and Bora the Spear from play

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:42.070
to Special Summon Blackwing 
- Aurora the Northern Lights!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:51.220
I can Special Summon it by removing a 
Blackwing and a Blackwing Tuner from play.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:56.430
This card's Level is equal to the total 
Level of the monsters that were removed from play.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:59.700
Next, Steam the Cloaked's effect activates!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:04.400
When this card leaves the field, I 
can Special Summon one Steam Token!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:09.370
But this Token is destroyed at the End Phase.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:13.210
Once per turn, by removing from 
play a Blackwing Synchro Monster

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:17.990
in my Extra Deck with the same Level 
as Aurora the Northern Lights...

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:21.820
...it gains its attack points 
and effects until my next turn!

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.890
Aurora the Northern Lights 
is Level 7, so I remove

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:30.260
Blackwing Armor Master in 
my Extra Deck from play!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:37.340
So Aurora the Northern Lights has 2500 
attack points, which is the same as Armor Master!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.670
And since this card gains 
Armor Master's effects,

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:49.240
it won't be destroyed in battle 
and takes 0 battle damage!

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.900
I see!  Since Aurora the Northern 
Lights isn't a Synchro Monster...

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:58.880
He can use Synchro Monster effects while 
avoiding Meklord Emperor's Synchro sealing.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.820
I didn't expect this strategy!

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:05.550
This is Crow's anti-Meklord Emperor strategy.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.530
Battle!

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:10.920
Aurora the Northern Lights 
attacks Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.940
No matter what your strategy, 
you can never have

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:18.960
more attack points than 
Meklord Emperor Granel.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.430
Your actions are pointless.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.450
No, it's not!

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:26.660
Aurora the Northern Lights has another 
one of Armor Master's effects!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:31.390
When this card attacks your monster, 
your monster gets a Wedge Counter.

00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.680
By removing the Wedge Counter, 
your monster's attack

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:38.420
and defense points become 0 
until that turn's End Phase!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:38.930
What?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:46.400
And when your monster's attack points become 
0, Steam Token removes that monster from play!

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:53.310
If he removes Granel from play, 
we will see the path to victory!

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:57.270
It doesn't matter how many attack 
points Meklord Emperor has!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:02.170
I created this special strategy 
to stop Synchro killers!  Take it!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:07.240
Your special strategy is weak.  
I said it was pointless.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.170
I activate Granel Guard's effect!

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:26.350
Granel Guard switches the attack target to a 
Synchro Monster that's equipped on Meklord Emperor.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.170
What?

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:40.480
No way!  Jack's Red Nova Dragon...

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:42.690
It became Crow's enemy.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:45.830
But due to Armor Master's effect, 
Aurora the Northern Lights

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.490
isn't destroyed, and he doesn't 
take any battle damage.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.970
Unbelievable!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:55.460
He used the absorbed Synchro 
Monster as a shield!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:06.190
You stuck a wedge into Red Nova 
Dragon, which is an Equip Card.

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:09.740
Therefore, you can't put 
a Wedge Counter on it!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.060
That's Meklord Emperor Granel's power...

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:22.780
Not only can it absorb Synchro Monsters, 
it can use them for defense.

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:28.500
Aurora the Northern Lights was Crow's best 
trump card to counter Meklord Emperor.

00:10:28.740 --> 00:10:31.750
But he dodged it.  What 
will you do now, Crow?

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:35.730
Steam Token will be destroyed 
at the End Phase.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:39.330
And the combo didn't work.  What should I do?

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.940
What can I do to counter 
him?  What else can I do?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.650
What's wrong?  Are you done?

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.550
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:56.950
That's the best you could 
do?  Your time is done.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.380
My turn!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.180
I activate Speed World 2's effect.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:08.700
I remove 10 Speed Counters to 
destroy one card on the field.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:13.560
I destroy Blackwing - Aurora 
the Northern Lights!

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.590
Then Meklord Emperor Granel 
attacks you directly!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:26.950
Leave the stage!

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:32.650
Whoa!  If this succeeds, Crow 
will have 0 life points!

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:35.530
It's over if he takes the direct attack!

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:36.370
Crow!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:38.850
Grand Slaughter Cannon!

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.270
Crow!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:53.390
Whoa!  Ghibli the Searing Wind is in defense 
position and blocks Granel's attack!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:58.860
When your monster attacks me directly, 
I can Special Summon it from my hand!

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:00.590
How annoying.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:05.810
He managed to stop it.

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:10.060
Sorry Ghibli, but I won't let 
your sacrifice go to waste!

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.610
I flip over my trap card!

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:12.800
Blackwing Revenge!

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:18.250
When my Winged-Beast Type monster with 
1000-or-fewer attack points is destroyed in battle...

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:22.510
I can Special Summon two 
Blackwing - Black Crest Tokens!

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:26.600
Then I flip over my trap card Blackboost!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:32.630
When there are two or more Blackwings on 
my field, I draw two cards from my deck!

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:39.330
Crow survived using consecutive 
miraculous combos!

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.310
How's that?  You haven't beaten me yet!

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.620
My attack isn't over.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:51.270
By summoning a monster in defense position, 
you've tightened the noose around your neck!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.490
What do you mean?

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:58.250
I activate Granel Attack's effect!

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:06.000
Once per turn, the monster that Granel 
absorbed can attack your monster!

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:10.710
Meklord Emperor can attack 
with the monsters it absorbed?

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:15.920
Go!  Battle your teammate, 
you foolish Synchro Monster!

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:18.940
The equipped monster deals piercing damage

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:22.060
equal to its attack points 
minus your defense points!

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.230
What?

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:27.010
Take your teammate's power and feel the pain!

00:13:30.690 --> 00:13:35.090
The Synchro Monster that Meklord Emperor 
Granel absorbed can't attack directly.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:41.140
You wouldn't have taken damage if you didn't 
summon a monster in defense position.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.100
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.300
Jack!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.800
Crow is in big trouble!

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:54.240
Is there anything he can do against the 
overwhelming power of Meklord Emperor Granel?

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:59.530
Jack knows that his monster 
is punishing Crow.

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.190
Jack felt this same pain.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:09.490
Now I have to face both 
Granel and Red Nova Dragon.

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:15.550
What can I do in this situation?

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:18.240
Isn't there anything he can do?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.850
The remaining Black Crest Token 
has only 800 defense points!

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:25.670
If he takes another attack 
from Red Nova Dragon,

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:30.920
he'll take 2700 points of piercing 
damage, and he'll have 0 life points.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.640
What's wrong?  Are you done?

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.140
My turn!

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:44.970
I tribute Black Crest Token to Tribute Summon 
Blackwing - Hillen the Tengu-wind in defense position!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.800
A monster with 2300 defense points.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:55.770
Now even if I take Red Nova Dragon's attack, 
I'll still have 100 life points left.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:15:03.160
But if you don't have a strategy after that, 
you'll take Meklord Emperor Granel's attack!

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.220
He's right.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:12.460
But when I take a direct attack 
that deals 2000 or more damage...

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:17.660
I can Special Summon Hillen the Tengu-wind and 
a Level 3-or-below Blackwing from my graveyard.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:22.370
And if I use Urgent Tuning 
to summon Black-Winged Dragon

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:27.760
in defense position, I can stop 
Granel's attack next turn.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:29.720
No, that's no good!

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.540
Even if I stop the attack, 
Meklord Emperor will destroy

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:35.880
Black-Winged Dragon and use 
its effect to absorb it.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:43.600
If that happens, Yusei will have to fight 
against Meklord Emperor and two Synchro Monsters.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:51.470
Even the anti-Synchro killer Red Nova 
Dragon didn't work against Granel.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.650
My Synchro Monster can't win.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:16:05.740
Does that mean there's nothing I can do?

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:09.920
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:16:09.920 --> 00:16:12.050
There's nothing I can do.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:16.420
I'm sorry, Yusei.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.610
Believe in your cards.

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:22.070
Believe in my cards?

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:26.490
This card is...

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:32.730
I see.  Even though I can't do anything, 
I can leave something for my friends.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.170
All right, I can do this!

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:39.200
I can do one last thing!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.670
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.640
He ended his turn?

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.410
There's nothing he can do?

00:16:50.180 --> 00:16:53.100
So that's the best a human can do.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:54.950
My turn!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:17:00.030
I activate Granel Attack's effect!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:05.560
Foolish Red Nova Dragon, 
attack Hillen the Tengu-wind!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.350
Crow only has 100 life points left!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.330
He's pushed to the brink!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:19.290
Oh no!

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:23.710
Is this the end?

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:28.060
Use your trump card and Synchro Summon!

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:30.320
You can't provoke me.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.900
If I summon it, Meklord Emperor 
will destroy and steal

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:38.000
my Synchro Monster and 
use it to attack Yusei.

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.170
I have to avoid that!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.810
Why do you have to avoid it?

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:44.780
What?

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:51.860
Friends who fight and hurt each other is 
the very nature of humanity's foolishness.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.560
Look at this repulsive figure.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:59.750
Synchro Monsters symbolize the 
evolution of humanity's foolishness!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:04.720
Whatever!  Red Nova Dragon is Jack's soul!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:08.910
We always fought alongside Synchro Monsters!

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:11.690
Don't you dare badmouth them!

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:17.830
You still haven't realized that 
those ideas lead to destruction!

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.320
What are you trying to say?

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:22.780
I have nothing more to say 
because you're going to perish!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:26.510
Battle!  Granel attacks you directly!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:30.880
Take Meklord Emperor's attack and vanish!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.620
Grand Slaughter Cannon!

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:36.210
Crow!

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:47.920
It's over!  The second Wheeler 
Crow has 0 life points!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:53.440
Team 5D's only has Yusei Fudo 
left as the last Wheeler!

00:18:54.060 --> 00:18:56.030
It's over.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.280
Not yet!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.340
The Battle Phase hasn't ended yet.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:05.450
Crow!

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:13.750
I activate Hillen the Tengu-wind's 
effect from the graveyard.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:18.830
When I take a direct attack that deals 
2000 or more points of damage...

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:24.150
I can Special Summon this card and a Level 
3-or-below Blackwing from my graveyard!

00:19:24.150 --> 00:19:28.460
Resurrect, Hillen the Tengu-wind 
and Ghibli the Searing Wind!

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:36.520
Then I activate the trap Urgent Tuning!

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:42.100
This card activates during the Battle Phase 
and Synchro Summons one Synchro Monster!

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:46.960
Level 5 Hillen the Tengu-wind tunes 
Level 3 Ghibli the Searing Wind!

00:19:47.390 --> 00:19:52.390
Black whirlwind, your secret 
thoughts appear on your wings!

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:54.570
Synchro Summon!

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.170
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:04.950
Whoa!  Meklord Emperor 
appeared to annihilate Crow,

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:10.930
but he mustered up his final strength 
to summon his ace Black-Winged Dragon!

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:14.860
Why?  If he activated Hillen the 
Tengu-wind's effect during the direct attack,

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:18.900
he could've used this combo 
to stop Granel's attack!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:23.440
Why did he activate it after he took damage?

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:30.390
Crow wanted to leave Black-Winged Dragon 
for Yusei, so he took Granel's attack.

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.620
That was Crow's goal.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:35.320
Crow...

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:41.990
You sacrificed yourself to 
summon a Synchro Monster?

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:46.050
That's right.  I lost in 
order for my team to win.

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:47.200
What?

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:51.540
You said that friends fight each other, 
but that's not the only side to humanity.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:56.710
We can also fight together by passing 
on my emotions to my friends.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.430
It's called a bond.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.400
Bond...

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.390
It was a bit rough this time.

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:09.660
Yusei, I leave the rest to you.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:19.780
Crow, you risked your life to give 
me Black-Winged Dragon's power.

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.770
I won't let it go to waste!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.690
Here I go.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.180
Yusei...

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:29.430
Do your best.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.390
Yeah!  Take care of Jack and Crow!

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:38.850
The baton has passed!

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:41.400
Both teams are down to their last Wheeler!

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:45.370
It's a one-on-one fight 
between Yusei Fudo and Jose!

00:22:05.700 --> 00:22:10.910
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:16.250
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:21.620
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:21.750 --> 00:22:24.360
Our hearts resonate

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:29.590
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:36.230
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.140 --> 00:22:42.970
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:48.050
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:54.220
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:54.220 --> 00:23:02.790
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:02.790 --> 00:23:08.400
We will draw it forever
